   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1453,
   "name": "Borgus Steelhand",
   "npc": "7232",
   "questID": 97894,
   "race": "Dwarf",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Pleasure to make yer acquaintance! Name's Borgus, of the one and only Steelhand family. You can always count on a Steelhand fer a fair deal!\r\n\r\nA few weeks back me brother Gorbold joined up with a merchant stall in Auberdine. Plenty of coin to be made supplyin' ships there, let me tell you! Lucky sod.\r\n\r\nI haven't heard from him since--mind checking on him if yer heading that way?\r\n\r\nThere's a new ship in the harbor that will take ye straight there. Head to the southern-most dock; can't miss it!",
   "time": 1791541425,
   "title": "Business in Auberdine",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Stormwind City"
  }
 },
